<blockquote>The Saborian Manifesto<br />We set out, and steer close to God.<br />The temptations of the stone are many, but we must remain true.<br />We do all that we can for Sabor, raising citizens to heaven, and rewarding the Pilipai who lift them there.<br />Together let us realise perfection.</blockquote>

<blockquote>From the new Stalk shall preside the Committee, and their table shall be provided for by the Assembly house, whose concerns shall rise and fall like waves.<br />To look outward, we shall look within.<br />Freedom. Equality. We are God.</blockquote>

